# The Vercel deployment is the dashboard only -- a single self-contained
# static HTML file (dashboard/index.html, generated by
# dashboard/build_dashboard.py, base64 fonts/logo inlined, no build step).
# Everything else in this repo (the Python engine, benchmark corpus, scale
# fixtures, investigation notes) is source for that generator, not part of
# what gets served, and would otherwise slow the upload and count against
# deployment size for no reason.
.venv/
.git/
.claude/
corpus/
engine/
holdout/
scale/
resolver/
resolver_contract/
matching/
ingest/
transport/
store/
service/
agents/
investigation/
eval/
tests/
spike/
*.md
!README.md
